      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dayton%2C_Idaho"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Dayton’s temperatures swing from below 0°F in winter to over 90°F in summer, a classic Cache Valley climate.",
